itten and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le01ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br/> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span>.<br/> Irregular verbs change in different ways.<br/> For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did</span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask ... ?</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to spill \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"spilled\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to copy \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"copied\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to like \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"liked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to help \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"helped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was, were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to meet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"met\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\