 friendly and efficient worker. He said he liked my report.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Who will you work with?", "id": 2, "time": "10500", "image": "engenn5le01ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I met one colleague with brown hair already. He seems like a warm person. I'll meet others next week.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: You will be busy. I hope you'll have some free time to see the pictures I send of cultural traditions around the world!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I hope so too!", "id": 3, "time": "28500", "image": "engenn5le01ob11re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le01ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le01ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}